<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix B Environment Details ‣ Online Process Reward Leanring for Agentic Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">SOTOPIA.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
