<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span><span id="S4.T2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Performance on Sotopia.</span> Self-Chat: the model being evaluated interacts with itself; GPT-4o-as-Patrner: the model interacts with GPT-4o. “Goal” refers to the goal completion score (0-10). “Hard” denotes a challenging subset of scenarios that demand for advanced reasoning, and “All” denotes the all set of social scenarios in SOTOPIA. Results are averaged over three random seeds.</figcaption>
